classes\ that\ are\ XxxResource\ classes\ should\ carry\ no\ JAX-RS\ or\ Bean\ Validation\ annotation,\ because\ the\ XxxApi\ interface\ carries\ every\ JAX-RS\ and\ Bean\ Validation\ annotation;\ move\ the\ annotation\ from\ XxxResource\ to\ the\ method\ or\ parameter\ on\ XxxApi=2d4a5537-4351-489d-be24-42797df1b8da
classes\ that\ are\ XxxResource\ classes\ should\ implement\ the\ XxxApi\ interface\ named\ after\ them,\ because\ the\ XxxApi\ interface\ is\ the\ contract\:\ declare\ the\ endpoints\ on\ XxxApi\ and\ let\ XxxResource\ implement\ it=18f973aa-ebc6-4afe-a804-9dd93d26dc20
classes\ that\ are\ api\ main\ classes\ should\ be\ contract\ types,\ because\ API\ code\ holds\ interfaces,\ records,\ enums,\ exceptions,\ annotations\ and\ final\ constant\ holders\ (only\ static\ final\ fields\ and\ a\ private\ constructor),\ carries\ no\ CDI\ scope,\ and\ depends\ only\ on\ java,\ javax,\ jakarta,\ org.eclipse.microprofile,\ annotation\ types\ and\ API\ code.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest=28147a90-1d98-4f2a-9c43-c74840946ff3
classes\ that\ are\ assignable\ to\ java.lang.Throwable\ and\ not\ are\ an\ exception\ mapper\ or\ inside\ one\ should\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'io.freedriver.autonomymcp',\ because\ the\ module\ keeps\ its\ domain\ exceptions\ in\ one\ package,\ io.freedriver.autonomymcp;\ move\ the\ exception\ class\ there=bb1bcc91-99c0-4d76-b576-80002fec860f
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ be\ implementation\ code\ when\ they\ implement\ an\ API\ interface,\ because\ a\ main\ class\ that\ implements\ an\ API\ interface\ is\ implementation\ code;\ a\ JAX-RS\ resource\ may\ implement\ its\ JAX-RS\ API\ interface,\ a\ generated\ MicroProfile\ REST\ client\ is\ exempt,\ and\ a\ record,\ enum,\ interface,\ exception\ or\ permitted\ subtype\ of\ a\ sealed\ API\ interface\ in\ API\ code\ may\ implement\ an\ API\ interface.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest=858b2111-a6d4-4609-bcdd-7a45ac01067e
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ be\ in\ a\ package\ that\ names\ a\ role,\ because\ a\ main\ class\ under\ io.freedriver\ is\ in\ a\ package\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ or\ below\ one;\ the\ utility\ artifactIds\ stereotypes,\ mcp-support,\ hit-window\ and\ freedriver-mqtt\ are\ exempt=4eb35bb0-34b4-43c9-8b5a-1d70425da41f
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ keep\ implementation\ packages\ private,\ because\ an\ implementation\ is\ a\ package\ io.freedriver..impl.<name>\ and\ its\ subpackages;\ only\ its\ own\ classes\ depend\ on\ it,\ and\ it\ depends\ on\ no\ class\ in\ a\ package\ io.freedriver..service..\ and\ on\ no\ other\ implementation=4ff23e64-0257-43a9-9c57-d30a241e1444
classes\ that\ are\ main\ classes\ of\ our\ modules\ should\ share\ their\ module's\ one\ role,\ because\ a\ module\ holds\ one\ role\:\ API,\ implementation,\ service\ or\ utility.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest=c8e3ae73-44a9-41ec-ae2a-817772d9aa42
classes\ that\ are\ service\ main\ classes\ should\ depend\ only\ on\ the\ service\ allowlist,\ because\ service\ code\ depends\ only\ on\ java,\ javax,\ jakarta,\ io.quarkus\ except\ io.quarkus.mongodb.panache\ and\ io.quarkus.hibernate.orm.panache,\ io.smallrye,\ org.eclipse.microprofile,\ io.micrometer,\ annotation\ types,\ service\ code\ of\ its\ own\ module,\ API\ code\ and\ the\ utility\ artifactIds\ stereotypes,\ mcp-support,\ hit-window\ and\ freedriver-mqtt.\ A\ class\ is\ API,\ implementation\ or\ service\ code\ by\ its\ package\:\ io.freedriver.<project>\ or\ io.freedriver.<project>.<area>,\ then\ api,\ impl.<name>\ or\ service,\ and\ the\ packages\ below\ it.\ A\ class\ in\ any\ other\ package\ takes\ its\ module's\ role\:\ API\ for\ an\ artifactId\ ending\ -api,\ -model\ or\ -contract,\ implementation\ for\ one\ ending\ -impl,\ service\ for\ the\ rest.\ An\ HTTP\ edge\ class,\ one\ that\ observes\ io.quarkus.vertx.http.runtime.filters.Filters\ or\ io.vertx.ext.web.Router,\ has\ a\ method\ annotated\ @io.quarkus.vertx.web.Route\ or\ @io.quarkus.vertx.web.RouteFilter,\ or\ implements\ an\ io.quarkus.oidc\ interface,\ may\ also\ depend\ on\ io.vertx.core\ and\ io.vertx.ext.web.\ An\ MCP\ edge\ class,\ one\ with\ a\ method\ annotated\ from\ io.quarkiverse.mcp.server\ or\ that\ implements\ an\ interface\ from\ that\ package,\ may\ also\ depend\ on\ io.quarkiverse.mcp.server=5cc860bb-9526-4f42-8b09-ba972f3b4348
methods\ that\ are\ declared\ in\ classes\ that\ are\ XxxResource\ classes\ and\ are\ public\ and\ are\ not\ marked\ @ReturnsResponse\ should\ not\ have\ raw\ return\ type\ jakarta.ws.rs.core.Response,\ because\ a\ resource\ method\ returns\ a\ typed\ DTO\ and\ throws\ a\ domain\ exception\ that\ an\ ExceptionMapper\ turns\ into\ a\ status;\ a\ redirect\ or\ stream\ that\ needs\ Response\ carries\ @ReturnsResponse("<reason>");\ declare\ that\ annotation\ once\ in\ this\ module\ as\ @Retention(RUNTIME)\ @Target(METHOD)\ public\ @interface\ ReturnsResponse\ {\ String\ value();\ }=bbbc245f-fae9-4869-8ad0-63e838697d39
no\ classes\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'io.smallrye.faulttolerance.api.RateLimit',\ because\ SmallRye\ @RateLimit\ is\ one\ bucket\ per\ bean\ method,\ not\ per\ caller;\ use\ the\ module's\ per-caller\ limiter\ (@RateLimited\ and\ the\ HitWindow)=5ea2469a-302a-412b-b1ba-23f41bf40f4b
no\ classes\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['java.net.http..',\ 'okhttp3..',\ 'org.apache.http..',\ 'org.apache.hc..',\ 'io.vertx.ext.web.client..',\ 'redis.clients.jedis..',\ 'io.lettuce..',\ 'org.redisson..']\ or\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'org.keycloak.admin.client.KeycloakBuilder',\ because\ outgoing\ HTTP\ uses\ a\ REST\ client\ interface\ (or\ sms-client,\ device-daemon),\ Redis\ uses\ the\ Quarkus\ Redis\ client,\ and\ the\ Keycloak\ admin\ client\ is\ the\ one\ the\ Quarkus\ extension\ injects=fb723370-e628-4efe-9eb3-b23c9457778e
no\ classes\ that\ are\ service\ unit\ tests\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'jakarta.ws.rs..',\ because\ a\ service\ unit\ test\ calls\ the\ service\ and\ asserts\ its\ result\ or\ domain\ exception;\ HTTP\ status\ belongs\ in\ the\ resource's\ @QuarkusTest=6487acb6-43e4-4148-a63e-971cf78e6c3a
no\ classes\ that\ not\ are\ a\ repository\ or\ inside\ one\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.mongodb.client..',\ because\ Mongo\ access\ goes\ through\ a\ *Repository\ (a\ PanacheMongoRepository);\ call\ the\ repository\ instead\ of\ the\ Mongo\ driver=933f61bc-1c51-43d4-968f-685fd3e87d5b
no\ classes\ that\ not\ are\ the\ JAX-RS\ edge\ or\ inside\ one\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'jakarta.ws.rs..',\ because\ JAX-RS\ belongs\ at\ the\ edge\:\ a\ class\ whose\ role,\ its\ own\ or\ its\ package's\ as\ RoleRules.role\ resolves\ it,\ is\ one\ @PrimaryAdapter\ or\ one\ @SecondaryAdapter,\ or,\ for\ a\ class\ with\ no\ hexagonal\ role,\ a\ *Resource,\ *Api,\ *Filter,\ *Mapper(s),\ @Provider\ or\ REST\ client\ interface.\ Throw\ a\ domain\ exception\ and\ map\ it\ to\ a\ status\ in\ the\ module's\ ErrorMappers,\ or\ move\ the\ HTTP\ type\ into\ an\ edge\ class=be6ff79c-9285-4cac-bff3-1da9f7cab5c8
no\ classes\ that\ not\ are\ the\ security\ edge\ or\ inside\ one\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'io.quarkus.security.identity.SecurityIdentity',\ because\ the\ identity\ is\ read\ at\ the\ edge\:\ one\ @PrimaryAdapter,\ on\ the\ class\ or\ its\ package\ as\ RoleRules.role\ resolves\ it,\ or,\ for\ a\ class\ with\ no\ hexagonal\ role,\ a\ *Resource,\ *Filter,\ *Feature,\ MCP\ *Tools\ class,\ identity\ augmentor,\ authentication\ mechanism,\ tenant\ resolver\ or\ tool\ filter;\ a\ @SecondaryAdapter\ is\ outside\ that\ edge;\ pass\ the\ service\ the\ subject\ or\ roles\ it\ needs\ as\ plain\ values=75b6ea79-c5e3-41f6-85e7-72a41c71336d
